{"title":"Aug 3 — South Jeju","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 3 — South Jeju"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Monday · August 3, 2026 · Day 9 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">South Jeju 🍵</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Yeomiji Botanical Garden · Osulloc Tea Museum · Comma Cafe · Jeju</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug03\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug03').setView([33.3300, 126.3500], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Grabel Hotel Jeju', lat:33.4996, lng:126.5312, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Grabel+Hotel+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Yeomiji Botanical Garden 🌸', lat:33.3059, lng:126.3130, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yeomiji+Botanical+Garden+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Jeju Sun Buckwheat Noodles 🍜', lat:33.3100, lng:126.3200, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jeju+buckwheat+noodles+restaurant' },\n    { name:'Osulloc Tea Museum 🍵', lat:33.3059, lng:126.2892, c:'#2E7D32', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Osulloc+Tea+Museum+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Comma Cafe ☕', lat:33.3100, lng:126.2900, c:'#AB47BC', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Comma+cafe+Jeju+west' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-03T09:30\" data-lat=\"33.3059\" data-lng=\"126.3130\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌸 Garden</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Yeomiji Botanical Garden</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Asia's largest botanical garden with 3,800+ species across themed greenhouses (tropical, subtropical, Mediterranean, desert) and beautiful outdoor gardens. The glass pyramids and cactus house are highlights. Entry ~₩14,000. Allow 2 hours.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yeomiji+Botanical+Garden+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Yeomiji</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/여미지식물원\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Lunch</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-03T12:00\" data-lat=\"33.3100\" data-lng=\"126.3200\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">12:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍜 Lunch</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Jeju Sun Buckwheat Noodles (메밀국수)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Jeju-style buckwheat noodles in a light broth — a regional specialty. The noodles are hand-made and the flavour is earthy and nutty. Perfect light lunch before the tea museum.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jeju+buckwheat+noodles+메밀국수\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Buckwheat Noodles</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주+메밀국수\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Tea Country</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-03T14:00\" data-lat=\"33.3059\" data-lng=\"126.2892\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">14:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🍵 Museum</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Osulloc Tea Museum</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korea's premier green tea museum set amid rolling tea plantations. The museum covers 4,000 years of Korean tea culture. Surrounded by Innisfree's green tea fields (same company). Must-try:\n      <ul>\n        <li>Osulloc green tea ice cream (삼다도 아이스크림)</li>\n        <li>Fresh brewed premium green tea</li>\n        <li>Tea field walk for photos</li>\n      </ul>\n      Free admission to museum grounds and gardens. In-store experiences cost extra.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Osulloc+Tea+Museum+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Osulloc</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/오설록티뮤지엄\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-03T16:30\" data-lat=\"33.3100\" data-lng=\"126.2900\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">☕ Cafe</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Comma Cafe</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">A peaceful, scenic cafe in the west Jeju area. Good for an afternoon coffee and dessert with views over the tea fields or coastal landscape.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Comma+cafe+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Comma Cafe</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/콤마카페+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-03T19:00\" data-lat=\"33.4996\" data-lng=\"126.5312\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag tbd\">FREE NIGHT</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍽️ Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Free Night — Explore Jeju City</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Final evening in Jeju! Options:\n      <ul>\n        <li>Jeju-style BBQ or galchi (hairtail fish) near the hotel</li>\n        <li>Dongmun Night Market revisit</li>\n        <li>Seafood raw fish restaurant (회) along the coast</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jeju+City+restaurants+for+dinner\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find Dinner</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/제주시+저녁+맛집\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\">Last night in Jeju! Check out tomorrow morning — flight to Busan at 13:00. <strong>Pack tonight</strong> and return rental car to Jeju One Car near airport before check-in.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Monday · August 3, 2026 · Day 9